    "answer": {
      "short": "The graph has maxima at $(0^\\circ,1)$, $(180^\\circ,1)$ and $(360^\\circ,1)$, minima at $(90^\\circ,-1)$ and $(270^\\circ,-1)$, and zeros at $45^\\circ$, $135^\\circ$, $225^\\circ$ and $315^\\circ$.\n\nPlot the tabulated values and join them with a smooth cosine curve; the period is $180^\\circ$.",
